rows.text:
Freeze models and full run/experiment/comparison identities before public execution.
Require prior/absent/negative/late/same-instant promise; failed/successful/unknown
outcome; separately changed intent and control at fixed outcome; misleading reports
and false correction at fixed hidden truth; foreign target/incident and missing link;
unknown versus false; current-person-only and outcome-only failures; retained history
and immutable judgments; goal-only consumer intervention; two observers and witness;
whole later-view privacy including a common subsequent received observation;
all-stage/commit rollback, malformed model/input/save and cross-owner rejection;
every complete prefix restored and advanced with exact whole-save equality.
